    "reviews": "\u201cGo and play it. Seriously. This demo is wonderful. I'm pretty sure Surmount's going to be wonderful. I'm pretty sure it's my game of this year's summer showcases.\u201d<br>Eurogamer<br><br>\u201cSurmount is a wonderful climbing adventure with 'gripping' gameplay that will keep you uttering the phrase &quot;one more try&quot; as you climb its gorgeous peaks.\u201d<br>Six One Indie<br>",
